[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5645.11, "timestamp": "01:34:05", "text": "橙子。正确的。我的天啊。第三个是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5648.31, "timestamp": "01:34:08", "text": "出去了，对吧？那个选项被排除在外。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5650.95, "timestamp": "01:34:10", "text": "现在？第二个。它开着吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5661.11, "timestamp": "01:34:21", "text": "我弄明白了。这将是。我是一名"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5663.11, "timestamp": "01:34:23", "text": "速度一。哦，第三个开始了。第三"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5671.11, "timestamp": "01:34:31", "text": "啊，你在这儿啊。你这混蛋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5678.47, "timestamp": "01:34:38", "text": "好的。现在呢？呃，就是那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5682.149, "timestamp": "01:34:42", "text": "三点开场。第二个仍然关闭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5687.189, "timestamp": "01:34:47", "text": "第二个仍然关闭。是的。一，二。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5690.31, "timestamp": "01:34:50", "text": "等等，告诉我这情况是不是要变了。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5692.229, "timestamp": "01:34:52", "text": "那是第一个吗？走了一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5695.03, "timestamp": "01:34:55", "text": "走了一个。走了一个。好的。知道了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5697.43, "timestamp": "01:34:57", "text": "一和三。中间那个。正确的。得到"}]